@startuml
title Sau khi sua: USB joystick dieu khien R3 gimbal

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor Operator
component "USB HID\nARGOSDYNE DR-1000" as USB
component "Joystick\n_applyHardcodedProfile()\n_handleAxis()" as Joystick
component "QGCCameraManager\n_gimbalAxisControl()" as Manager
component "CodevCameraControl\ngimbalAxisRateControl()" as Camera
component "MAVLink encoder\n_sendR3RcChannels()" as Mavlink
cloud "Vehicle link\nUDP or serial" as Link
component "R3 camera and gimbal" as R3

Operator --> USB : Move tilt or pan stick
USB --> Joystick : Raw axes 0 and 3
Joystick --> Manager : gimbalAxisControl(pitch, yaw)
Manager --> Camera : gimbalAxisRateControl(pitch, yaw)
Camera --> Mavlink : RC_CHANNELS\nCH9 pitch, CH10 yaw\nCH11 and CH15 = 1500
Mavlink --> Link : MAVLink message
Link --> R3 : Forward RC_CHANNELS
R3 --> R3 : Move pitch or yaw

note right of Joystick
  Forced DR-1000 profile
  axis 0 = gimbal pitch
  axis 3 = gimbal yaw
  center = 0
  range = -32767 to 32767
  deadband = 2000
  output = -1.0 to 1.0
end note

note bottom of Camera
  R3 input conversion
  -1.0 to 1.0 becomes PWM 1000 to 2000
  center PWM is 1500
  zero input sends a stop command immediately
end note

note bottom of Joystick
  DR-1000 is a gimbal-only profile.
  It does not send flight MANUAL_CONTROL.
end note

@enduml
